  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\">請注意，要讓此模組正常運作，你需要同時安裝 cobblemon 和我的資源庫。</span></h2>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Cobblemon：Poke Lab's 寶可實驗室</h1>\n<p>◽ 新增一個稀有建築，內有治療和處理你的寶可夢的設備，以及 5 個戰利品箱子。<br>◽ 稍微改善遊戲中箱子的戰利品內容</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f7701d80-2f75-4955-a0e6-843ce19770af.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_08caadc5-0be4-46e2-b006-3aec87200794.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img style=\"float: left;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_050be908-3c00-46b5-acad-6f35724bf5a2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"338\" height=\"362\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_84c5339a-cab7-49b7-be04-09735449a5e7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"380\" height=\"363\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">模型製作：@<a href=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/member/webslinger2203/\" rel=\"nofollow\">webslinger2203</a><br><br><br></h3>",
